### GET ================== Admin Dashboard ==================
GET {{base_url}}/admin/dashboard
Cookie: authToken={{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json


### GET ================== Company Route ==================
GET {{base_url}}/company/get-company
Cookie: authToken={{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json


